                    <section class="mainPgGrp">
                        <h1 id="pageTitleHead">
                            Commissioners Court: Precincts and State Districts
                        </h1>
                        

<section>
</section>
                        <div class="mainPgContent">
                            <section role="region" aria-label="Main page content" id="ccMainSection">



<div class="">
<p>The current county commissioner, justice of the peace, constable and voting precincts, as well as state congressional
      district within Collin County, are listed below.</p><h2>County Precincts</h2><div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: flex-start; margin-bottom: 1em"><div style="flex: 0 0 175px; margin-right: 10px"><a target="_blank" href="https://maps.collincountytx.gov/ccmap_precincts/"><img src="/images/default-source/commissioners-court-images/precincts/votepcts8x11.jpg?sfvrsn=abbe35d6_1" width="175" alt="Voting Precincts Interactive Map"></a>
 </div><div style="flex: 1"><h3>Voting Precincts</h3><p>Adopted by Commissioners Court on August 26, 2019. Effective January 1, 2020.</p><p><a target="_blank" href="https://maps.collincountytx.gov/ccmap_precincts/" data-sf-ec-immutable="">Voting
 Precincts Interactive Map</a><br><a href="/docs/default-source/commissioners-court/maps/votepcts8x11.pdf?sfvrsn=3e2dee3b_3" target="_blank">Voting Precincts PDF Map</a>
